456
00:54:02,120 --> 00:54:23,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Lastly, we have provided additional funding for the improvement and upgrading of various airports across the country to enhance regional connectivity, [unclear], and economic development and ensure safer, more convenient, and reliable air travel for our Kababayans. Mr. President, we are now ready to answer questions from our colleagues.

