05:44:47,480 --> 05:44:50,760
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: had asked to be excused because he's in FIFA today

3176
05:44:50,760 --> 05:44:56,260
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: trying to get a $25 million sports development, football development initiative

3177
05:44:56,260 --> 05:44:57,260
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: to build a multipurpose...

3178
05:44:58,340 --> 05:45:00,000
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: ...football stadium and...

3179
05:45:00,000 --> 05:45:00,820
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: as other initiatives.

3180
05:45:02,140 --> 05:45:05,620
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I said that it's okay as long as he comes back next week on Thursday

3181
05:45:05,620 --> 05:45:11,000
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: before the budget is approved and ratified on second reading.

3182
05:45:11,560 --> 05:45:13,720
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So he'll be coming, Mr. President, as told.

3183
05:45:13,880 --> 05:45:14,920
