3184
05:45:15,060 --> 05:45:19,880
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In fact, I had the opportunity to meet the FIFA president during ASEAN.

3185
05:45:20,000 --> 05:45:20,880
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I think he was here.

3186
05:45:22,460 --> 05:45:24,140
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pato Gregorio introduced me to them.

3187
05:45:24,140 --> 05:45:27,960
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And yes, FIFA is very interested in investing in the Philippines

3188
05:45:27,960 --> 05:45:32,540
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: to boost our sports activities here.

3189
05:45:33,380 --> 05:45:34,880
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mr. President, if I may.

3190
05:45:35,480 --> 05:45:36,980
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yes, we recognize Senator Joe.

3191
05:45:37,120 --> 05:45:41,940
Senator Joel Villanueva: This is just a short manifestation with regard to the manifestation

3192
05:45:41,940 --> 05:45:45,320
Senator Joel Villanueva: or statements made by our distinguished majority leader.

3193
05:45:45,740 --> 05:45:47,700
Senator Joel Villanueva: I just want to put on record, Mr. President,

3194
05:45:47,700 --> 05:45:52,720
Senator Joel Villanueva: that since the day I became a member of the legislature,

3195
05:45:53,620 --> 05:45:55,540
Senator Joel Villanueva: not too long ago, Mr. President,

3196
05:45:55,540 --> 05:46:01,700
Senator Joel Villanueva: in the House of Representatives and as a member of this August Chamber

3197
05:46:01,700 --> 05:46:06,460
Senator Joel Villanueva: of this institution, we have yet to deliberate on a budget

3198
05:46:06,460 --> 05:46:12,240
Senator Joel Villanueva: without the head or chair of the agency or the department.

3199
05:46:12,520 --> 05:46:19,220
Senator Joel Villanueva: However, Mr. President, we are aware of the importance of this meeting

3200
05:46:19,220 --> 05:46:21,800
Senator Joel Villanueva: being held right now outside the country.

3201
05:46:21,800 --> 05:46:25,240
Senator Joel Villanueva: And we feel that it is important that,

3202
05:46:25,540 --> 05:46:29,300
Senator Joel Villanueva: as the head of FIFA who went here in the Philippines,

3203
05:46:30,900 --> 05:46:34,880
Senator Joel Villanueva: go out of his way to come visit our beloved country.

3204
05:46:34,880 --> 05:46:41,360
Senator Joel Villanueva: And so I was told, Mr. President, that the meeting being held outside the country right now

3205
05:46:43,360 --> 05:46:49,060
Senator Joel Villanueva: is a very important meeting where we can actually get an opportunity

3206
05:46:49,060 --> 05:46:52,460
Senator Joel Villanueva: to have a lot of grants and

3207
05:46:52,460 --> 05:46:52,960
Senator Joel Villanueva: the

3208
05:46:55,540 --> 05:47:03,700
Senator Joel Villanueva: details with the FIFA headed, of course, by our Philippine Sports Commission chairperson,

3209
05:47:03,700 --> 05:47:05,380
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pato Gregorio.

3210
05:47:05,380 --> 05:47:08,780
Senator Joel Villanueva: We post no objection, Mr. President.

3211
05:47:08,780 --> 05:47:13,220
Senator Joel Villanueva: However, we'd like to put on record that this should not be a precedent

3212
05:47:13,220 --> 05:47:20,980
Senator Joel Villanueva: and this should not be emulated by anyone heading the departments or agencies

3213
05:47:20,980 --> 05:47:25,000
Senator Joel Villanueva: because today, Mr. President, no less than the vice president herself,

3214
05:47:25,000 --> 05:47:30,960
Senator Joel Villanueva: came here and showed up during the budget deliberation.

3215
05:47:31,100 --> 05:47:34,320
Senator Joel Villanueva: So that's all, Mr. President, for us to be clear.

3216
05:47:35,500 --> 05:47:36,340
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you very much, Mr. President.

3217
05:47:36,340 --> 05:47:41,900
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yes, it's a time-honored tradition that the head of agency comes to the Senate

3218
05:47:41,900 --> 05:47:45,600
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: to defend their own budget, to justify their own budget.

3219
05:47:45,720 --> 05:47:48,060
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's their budget, so they should be the ones to defend it.

3220
05:47:49,640 --> 05:47:53,520
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So this is an exception rather than a rule.

3221
05:47:53,520 --> 05:47:54,920
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And that's why, too,

3222
05:47:55,000 --> 05:48:00,560
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: to compensate that exception before the budget gets approved on second reading,

3223
05:48:01,040 --> 05:48:04,000
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: they will be requested to come here to the Senate

3224
05:48:04,000 --> 05:48:09,800
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: to participate in the discussions.

3225
