3229
05:48:20,760 --> 05:48:22,400
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: or we just lessen their budget

3230
05:48:22,400 --> 05:48:24,640
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: and give it to another...

3231
05:48:24,640 --> 05:48:29,180
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: department who are more willing to defend their budget.

3232
05:48:29,320 --> 05:48:33,480
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So their promise naman is to come before the period of amendments.

3233
05:48:33,480 --> 05:48:38,160
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, forewarned, those agencies that were not here,

3234
05:48:38,360 --> 05:48:39,780
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: the heads of agencies were not here,

3235
05:48:40,180 --> 05:48:41,580
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: we're forewarning them now

3236
05:48:41,580 --> 05:48:44,740
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: that there's a chance na mabawasan po yung budget nila

3237
05:48:44,740 --> 05:48:46,400
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: kung di sila pong sumipot dito.

3238
05:48:46,460 --> 05:48:46,640
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Correct.

3239
05:48:46,840 --> 05:48:49,320
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And like what Senator Joel mentioned,

3240
05:48:49,480 --> 05:48:52,580
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: no less than the vice president of our country came here

3241
05:48:52,580 --> 05:48:54,480
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: to defend her budget and to...

3242
05:48:54,640 --> 05:48:58,540
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: justify her budget for 2027.

3243
05:48:58,920 --> 05:49:00,940
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So we'll make sure

3244
05:49:00,940 --> 05:49:05,420
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: well, the people from the PSC is here

3245
05:49:05,420 --> 05:49:09,760
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: so I'm sure that they will relay the message to Mr. Gregorio.

3246
05:49:10,540 --> 05:49:13,060
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So with that, we recognize Senator Pia Cayetano.

3247
05:49:14,640 --> 05:49:16,020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you, Mr. President.

