Senator Pia S. Cayetano: it's true that many don't know the challenges

3262
05:50:03,260 --> 05:50:06,860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: that these athletes went through to get to that elite level.

3263
05:50:07,260 --> 05:50:09,260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But with social media today,

3264
05:50:09,920 --> 05:50:13,280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and even AI that comes up with all these interesting

3265
