3297
05:51:48,960 --> 05:51:52,200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and then all the way through the pandemic.

3298
05:51:52,200 --> 05:51:53,360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, dalawang anak ko yun.

3299
