Senator Pia S. Cayetano: because nga, less ang opportunity

3324
05:52:46,480 --> 05:52:49,480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: for tournaments for the girls there.

3325
05:52:49,980 --> 05:52:51,560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, we need more of this.

3326
05:52:51,560 --> 05:52:52,840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I'm preaching to the choir

3327
05:52:52,840 --> 05:52:54,220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: because alam ko lahat naman kayo,

3328
05:52:54,640 --> 05:52:55,340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: gusto nyo yan.

3329
05:52:56,220 --> 05:52:58,180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It's really, I think,

3330
05:52:58,360 --> 05:53:00,500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I guess, Mr. Chairman, Mr. President,

3331
05:53:00,780 --> 05:53:03,500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: yung siguro yung, ano ko,

3332
05:53:03,640 --> 05:53:08,680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: yung gusto kong ma-achieve on this point sa grassroots

3333
05:53:08,680 --> 05:53:11,720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: is that all the NSAs have a plan

3334
05:53:11,720 --> 05:53:13,640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: on how to develop that sport

3335
05:53:13,640 --> 05:53:15,880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: in different parts of the country.

3336
05:53:16,160 --> 05:53:19,120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Imposible naman kasi yung all parts right away.

3337
05:53:19,280 --> 05:53:19,800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Imposible.

3338
05:53:19,800 --> 05:53:22,580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I know because I'm supporting the development

3339
05:53:22,580 --> 05:53:24,220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: of many new sports, eh.

3340
05:53:24,640 --> 05:53:29,740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, it just so happens na I was asking my staff,

3341
05:53:29,820 --> 05:53:31,320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: ano ba yung mga bagong sport, no?

3342
05:53:31,360 --> 05:53:36,860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yung mga new sports that might go to the Olympics.

3343
05:53:37,040 --> 05:53:38,840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And interestingly, the sports that I do,

