Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then the other one is paddle,

3354
05:54:02,240 --> 05:54:03,180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: which I also play.

3355
05:54:03,560 --> 05:54:04,760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And I think pickleball also.

3356
05:54:04,940 --> 05:54:06,120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Medyo mas malayo si pickleball,

3357
05:54:06,200 --> 05:54:08,000
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: wala pa akong nababalitaan na mag-olympics yun.

3358
05:54:08,100 --> 05:54:11,260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But for paddle and hybrid racing,

3359
05:54:11,840 --> 05:54:14,320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: there's a big chance it will be in,

3360
05:54:14,740 --> 05:54:18,040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: not naman LA, pero the succeeding ones.

3361
05:54:18,040 --> 05:54:19,120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Anyway, my point is,

3362
05:54:19,680 --> 05:54:21,400
